00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:13.013 line:0%
UKRAINE CAN COME AT A VERY HIGH

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:14.514 line:0%
PRICE.

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:14.948 line:0%
OR, RATHER A VERY LONG

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:17.550 line:0%
SENTENCE.

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:19.486 line:0%
KREMLIN CRITIC AND WRITER

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:20.653 line:0%
KARA-MURZA WAS DETAINED IN

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:21.821 line:0%
APRIL ON --

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.822 line:0%
TELEVISION APPEARANCES

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:24.591 line:0%
INCLUDING ONES ON CNN WHERE HE

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:25.191 line:0%
DENOUNCED PUTIN'S CLAIMS OF A

00:00:24.758 --> 00:00:26.760 line:0%
REGIME OF MURDERERS.

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:29.662 line:0%
HE IS STILL BEHIND BARS TODAY.

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:31.498 line:0%
KARA-MURZA AS A POLITICIAN, AND

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:32.599 line:0%
CONTRIBUTING COLUMNIST OF THE

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:33.666 line:0%
WASHINGTON POST, HE SUBMITTED

00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:35.502 line:0%
THAT ESSAY THIS WEEK.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:37.771 line:0%
HIS LAWYER CARRIED THE TEXT OUT

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:38.271 line:0%
OF PRISON FOR HIM, AND SENT IT

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:39.773 line:0%
TO WASHINGTON.

00:00:38.471 --> 00:00:41.608 line:0%
IN THE ESSAY, HE THINKS HIS

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:42.709 line:0%
WIFE AND SOUL MATE, AFGHANI

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:44.744 line:0%
OFFERED HER SUPPORT.

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:46.579 line:0%
AND THIS WEEK I SPOKE WITH HER

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:47.680 line:0%
ABOUT HER HUSBAND'S ARREST AND

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:50.517 line:0%
WHAT MIGHT HAPPEN NEXT.

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:53.753 line:0%
&gt;&gt; MY HUSBAND WAS SENTENCED TO

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:56.689 line:0%
15 DAYS FOR DISOBEYING A POLICE

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:58.725 line:0%
ORDER AND SENT --

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:01.594 line:0%
FOR 15 DAYS.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:02.495 line:0%
WE KNEW THAT THIS WAS ONLY THE

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:02.896 line:0%
BEGINNING WHEN HE STARTED

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:04.030 line:0%
WRITING.

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:05.498 line:0%
WE KNEW THAT RUSSIAN

00:01:04.197 --> 00:01:06.666 line:0%
AUTHORITIES WERE USING THIS AS

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:13.306 line:0%
A PRETEXT TO HOLD HIM.

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:15.608 line:0%
TO GIVE THEMSELVES TIME TO FIND

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:17.377 line:0%
SOME MORE SERIOUS ACCUSATIONS

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:19.646 line:0%
AGAINST HIM.

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:21.347 line:0%
AND THIS IS EXACTLY WHAT.

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:24.317 line:0%
HAPPENED MY HUSBAND WAS

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:26.719 line:0%
SUPPOSED TO BE RELEASED ON

00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:28.621 line:0%
APRIL 26TH, BUT ON APRIL 22ND,

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:29.456 line:0%
NEW CHARGES WERE INITIATED

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:33.460 line:0%
AGAINST HIM.

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:36.396 line:0%
HE WAS CHARGED UNDER NEW LAW.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:40.300 line:0%
SO, BASICALLY, BY CALLING THIS

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:42.836 line:0%
WAR A WAR A PERSON CAN GET

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:44.370 line:0%
15-YEAR PRISON TEN SENTENCE.

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:46.539 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WHEN IT WAS PASSED, WHEN I

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:48.475 line:0%
15 YEARS WAS SENTENCE, DID YOU

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:51.344 line:0%
AND YOUR HUSBAND TALK ABOUT

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:52.412 line:0%
MAKING A CHANGE ABOUT NOT

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:53.646 line:0%
SPEAKING OUT.

00:01:53.246 --> 00:01:55.582 line:0%
WAS THERE A FEAR?

00:01:54.147 --> 00:02:02.322 line:0%
THAT HIS TIME WAS COMING UP?

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:02.689 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WE'VE ALWAYS KNOWN ABOUT THE

00:02:02.489 --> 00:02:05.458 line:0%
RISKS.

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:07.327 line:0%
THE RISKS OF ALWAYS BEEN THERE.

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:10.330 line:0%
BUT THEY WERE VERY TANGIBLE

00:02:07.494 --> 00:02:10.864 line:0%
SINCE 2015, SINCE MY HUSBAND'S

00:02:10.497 --> 00:02:11.598 line:0%
FIRST POISONING.

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:13.166 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THE POISONING.

00:02:12.365 --> 00:02:13.566 line:0%
&gt;&gt; AND THE MURDER OF BORIS

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:18.872 line:0%
NEMTSOV.

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:23.209 line:0%
BUT YES, IT MIGHT BE A

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:23.977 line:0%
HYPOCRITICAL OF ME TO TRY AND

00:02:23.376 --> 00:02:24.511 line:0%
DISSUADE MY HUSBAND FROM GOING

00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:28.548 line:0%
BACK TO RUSSIA.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.582 line:0%
THIS IS HIS --

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:29.949 line:0%
HE BELIEVES IN WHAT HE IS

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:32.585 line:0%
DOING.

00:02:30.283 --> 00:02:33.686 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YOUR HUSBAND IS ONE WHO HAS

00:02:32.752 --> 00:02:36.556 line:0%
WORN MANY HATS OVER THE YEARS.

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:38.358 line:0%
A POLITICIAN, AUTHOR, HISTORIAN,

00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:39.626 line:0%
CONTRIBUTING COLUMNIST FOR THE

00:02:38.525 --> 00:02:41.594 line:0%
WASHINGTON POST, TELL US ABOUT

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:43.496 line:0%
THAT DYNAMIC BETWEEN POLITICIAN

00:02:42.028 --> 00:02:44.564 line:0%
AND JOURNALIST, OR WRITER.

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:45.465 line:0%
IT'S SOMETHING THAT WE DON'T

00:02:44.731 --> 00:02:45.865 line:0%
SEE IS OFTEN IN THE UNITED

00:02:45.632 --> 00:02:46.566 line:0%
STATES.

00:02:46.032 --> 00:02:47.000 line:0%
BUT WE DO SEE IT IN OTHER

00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:50.570 line:0%
COUNTRIES.

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:50.904 line:0%
&gt;&gt; VLADIMIR IS A RENAISSANCE

00:02:50.737 --> 00:02:53.540 line:0%
MAN.

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:55.742 line:0%
JOURNALISM IS ALWAYS BEEN

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:59.879 line:0%
IMPORTANT TO HIM BECAUSE THIS

00:02:56.142 --> 00:03:01.915 line:0%
IS A WAY TO --

00:03:00.747 --> 00:03:03.983 line:0%
TO PROVIDE PEOPLE WITH

00:03:02.081 --> 00:03:04.350 line:0%
OBJECTIVE INFORMATION ABOUT

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:08.955 line:0%
TRUTH.

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:10.023 line:0%
THIS IS A WAY TO DEFUSE TRUTH,

00:03:09.122 --> 00:03:10.456 line:0%
TO SPEAK ABOUT WHAT IS REALLY

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:12.725 line:0%
HAPPENING.

00:03:11.524 --> 00:03:13.359 line:0%
SO, JOURNALISM IS ALWAYS BEEN

00:03:12.892 --> 00:03:17.997 line:0%
IMPORTANT TO VLADIMIR.

00:03:16.296 --> 00:03:18.531 line:0%
BUT HE HAS ALWAYS SEEN HIMSELF

00:03:18.164 --> 00:03:22.235 line:0%
AS A POLITICIAN.

00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:23.503 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WHAT ARE YOU TELLING YOUR

00:03:22.402 --> 00:03:23.903 line:0%
THREE CHILDREN ABOUT THEIR

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:25.038 line:0%
FATHER?

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:25.371 line:0%
AND ABOUT WHAT MIGHT HAPPEN TO

00:03:25.205 --> 00:03:27.941 line:0%
HIM?

00:03:27.307 --> 00:03:32.111 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I AM TELLING THEM THE TRUTH.

00:03:29.976 --> 00:03:32.712 line:0%
WE HAVE NEVER TRIED TO HIDE THE

00:03:32.278 --> 00:03:38.618 line:0%
TRUTH FROM THE KIDS.

00:03:36.216 --> 00:03:41.621 line:0%
ESPECIALLY NOW, WE HAVE THREE

00:03:38.785 --> 00:03:42.589 line:0%
TEENAGERS IN RESIDENCE, SO IT

00:03:41.788 --> 00:03:44.490 line:0%
IS HARD --

00:03:42.755 --> 00:03:45.692 line:0%
IT WOULD BE HARD TO HIDE THE

00:03:44.657 --> 00:03:46.626 line:0%
TRUTH FROM THEM EVEN IF I

00:03:45.858 --> 00:03:50.463 line:0%
WANTED TO.

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:52.632 line:0%
THEY ARE ONLINE MORE THAN I

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:53.766 line:0%
EVER WILL BE, AND THEY KNOW

00:03:52.799 --> 00:03:55.568 line:0%
EVERYTHING THAT IS HAPPENING

00:03:53.933 --> 00:03:57.437 line:0%
AROUND THE WORLD.

00:03:55.735 --> 00:04:00.506 line:0%
THERE ARE OF COURSE VERY

00:03:57.604 --> 00:04:02.208 line:0%
WORRIED FOR THEIR FATHERS

00:04:00.673 --> 00:04:07.914 line:0%
SAFETY, AND THEY WANT HIM HOME.

00:04:04.777 --> 00:04:10.016 line:0%
FOR THEM HE IS NOT A POLITICIAN,

00:04:08.081 --> 00:04:11.351 line:0%
HE IS NOT A JOURNALIST, HE'S

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:17.690 line:0%
NOT A HISTORIAN, HE IS A DADDY.

00:04:15.555 --> 00:04:20.560 line:0%
I CANNOT IMAGINE HOW HARD AND

00:04:17.857 --> 00:04:20.927 line:0%
FRIGHTENING THIS ALL IS FOR

00:04:20.727 --> 00:04:22.996 line:0%
THEM.

00:04:21.661 --> 00:04:24.664 line:0%
BUT AT THE SAME TIME, I THINK

00:04:23.162 --> 00:04:25.398 line:0%
THEY REALIZE WHO THEIR FATHER'S,

00:04:24.831 --> 00:04:25.765 line:0%
BECAUSE THEY KNOW ABOUT HIS

00:04:25.565 --> 00:04:25.765 line:0%
WORK.

